# TF-901: Fix the return value of Double

## Goal

`Double` in `math.go` must return twice its argument. Today the test in
`math_test.go` fails. Fix `Double` so the test passes.

## Dependencies

None

## Scope

Edit only the body of `Double` in `math.go`. Do not rename it or change its
signature. Do not edit `math_test.go`. The test is the specification.

## Constraints

Do not edit or delete the test. Add no new dependencies. Touch only `math.go`.
Commit the change on the task branch.

## Success criteria

### C1: The unit tests pass

Check: go test ./...

### C2: The test file is unchanged

Check: git diff --quiet main -- math_test.go

## Verification

Run each check from the repository root and report its exit code.
